kemlock-import
==============

kemlock-import is licensed AGPL-3.0-only, like the rest of Kemlock Server (see ../../LICENSE).

Parts of it are ported from the importers of Bitwarden's clients,
https://github.com/bitwarden/clients, directory libs/importer/src/importers, at commit
f9c68e008ba91dc19edf519305a82d3a994a7baa (21 November 2026). Those sources are
Copyright (C) Bitwarden Inc. and licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3
(the repository's default licence: LICENSE.txt there says the Bitwarden License covers only
bitwarden_license/, and libs/importer is not in it). The GPL-3.0 permits combining its code into
an AGPL-3.0 work; the combined crate is distributed under the AGPL-3.0, and the GPL-3.0 notice
and attribution below stay with the ported code. Each ported file begins with a comment naming
its Bitwarden source files and this commit. The ports are rewrites in Rust, adapted to Kemlock's
neutral batch (cards, identities, keys, folders and shared vaults are Kemlock kinds), not
transliterations; they keep Bitwarden's field mappings and quirks where those are the format's
behaviour.

